msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I remember that day clear as crystal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫到现在我都清楚地记得……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_E78553CD_4C95_4319_A3B1_62E2A964DE0C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 523f48219ed094ef4cd7fda4e57fcbf9aa49e5d70188fe94f191536090d5b6f1
#. default-sha256: 5c653df9d3c1f1f3e8dc280848ab6c7462631781bd308584886f0bcd054779ad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_E78553CD_4C95_4319_A3B1_62E2A964DE0C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Ah, yes, I have to say, the food here is ⟪k:10⟫"
"spectacular⟪k:11⟫.⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫And I love that they give you so much meat.⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫Though I "
"thought my gut’d explode the first time I saw it, hahaha!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫不错、⟪k:10⟫不错。⟪k:11⟫话说回来，⟪k:12⟫这里的料"
"理真是一绝啊。⟪k:13⟫肉料理分量足，这点真不错。⟪k:14⟫一开始我还担心会吃坏肚子呢，⟪k:15⟫哈哈哈！"

#: scenario2:scenario2_525F4CC9_9163_4241_937D_1FD6C484547A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e5b86260213739758d5a1cc1a7d7ddc5d6b1857ebdfcc54299a0f38d9796425b
