msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_59EC1995_9F69_4928_B63F_A488984FD7D5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It’s hot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫好热。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_48688F6C_4A2D_4F6F_8035_0F50B05DBDCA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2526ebde929ff320670a8782d3c1fb44b35d32034ddd1cb0821c79c37037ac36
#. default-sha256: d193a98dc576615d296ba89ca60a1c03d3f676869fda9af33c9f8958368a6fe4
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_48688F6C_4A2D_4F6F_8035_0F50B05DBDCA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My parents’ relationship is on thin ice, but the air feels like it’s on fire. ⟪k:1⟫It’s much "
"too hot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫妈妈和爸爸的关系分明冷淡得快结冰了，⟪k:1⟫相反这天气就跟着了火似的。⟪k:2⟫热死了。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_9E8AA447_803D_4FF2_867B_0D87BF0DBCA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42d3ceb974a48fac7c9817ef2fb35765b1d2b02d768f56250e3f330dbcf0f7ae
#. default-sha256: 1ce8442092bf35c50f0998f40c531220414d49511a8d392e438be582b1b382ad
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_9E8AA447_803D_4FF2_867B_0D87BF0DBCA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫My dad loves this seaside restaurant. ⟪k:1⟫It actually specializes in fish, but he always "
"asks for meat."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫爸爸非常喜欢沿海的餐馆。⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫店里主要卖的是鱼料理，⟪k:3⟫但爸爸每次都点肉料理。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_7568A884_1212_4814_AD60_5BB3B1D66CA4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 325f5f06847b66c804f799ca973f2cfda8b37b8019f168e0d0be9044fe888f40
#. default-sha256: 75ad95417378991924ad19a1edd51929d9c4ba59f50cba8e3bcbd700455d3a96
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7568A884_1212_4814_AD60_5BB3B1D66CA4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though “always” isn’t very often. He’s out of the country most of the time, so we rarely eat "
"together as a family."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫虽说是「每次」，⟪k:1⟫但其实爸爸常常出门在外，⟪k:2⟫一家人聚在一起的时间也没有多少。"

#: scenario2:scenario2_4714BF7B_C21A_4DE6_A54C_A5E914690614
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ae0e8615fb7ae53015de54cc535edf7378ba32eb83848405a4353a0a4aa0aa1
#. default-sha256: 9cf821bbc09fd4065453f11f57216c7916ea5d5c871933a11d51e2898fda4522
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_4714BF7B_C21A_4DE6_A54C_A5E914690614"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For that reason, I can usually put up with a little heat for a family gathering..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以在烈日炎炎下吃饭，⟪k:1⟫还是可以忍耐的……"

#: scenario2:scenario2_661F5F0B_7579_4EB8_8409_389E7F436747
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb6d0a7cf63011e1c032a03b5c3cc2a4e83c297a2f514abdae102662fa44cf13
